      "writtenOn": "2023-04-27T20:11:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The change upstream was to remove `unnecessary casts` actually https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/crosvm/crosvm/+/4391102. We can ask to revert the change, otherwise we would have to look at upstreaming to libc and update the lib.\n\nHere\u0027s the difference in libc (c_int vs c_uint).\nAndroid: https://github.com/rust-lang/libc/blob/8077351f4b28a1b9fc46e2ac11a530d782264273/src/unix/linux_like/android/mod.rs#L1223\nLinux: https://github.com/rust-lang/libc/blob/86593ceee82f9d7880f572917dab88f9c6c5cf60/src/unix/linux_like/linux/mod.rs#L1919 \n\n@dverkamp@chromium.org any thoughts on reverting, even if it means having unnecessary casts on linux?",
      "parentUuid": "f0db3a17_dc009271",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 542,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 542,
        "endChar": 61
      },
      "revId": "53a0e3a9cefded1849f2dd8420dcaf235a6d0fca",
