        "id": 1572669
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-04-27T20:21:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If the casts are required on Android\u0027s libc, they can be re-added, but it will need to be guarded with an `#[allow(clippy::whatever_lint)]` and a comment explaining why it\u0027s needed.\n\nIt would be great if we could get at least compile-testing against bionic (or whatever libc android is using now) in upstream crosvm so this can be caught earlier.",
